yar-rs
Copyright 2026 the yar-rs contributors

This product includes a Rust implementation of the Yar RPC wire protocol
and data model. The protocol was originally implemented in C by Xinchen
Hui and contributors in the Yar project (https://github.com/laruence/yar).

The C sources that were present in this repository's earlier history are
retained in the git history for provenance. The current crate contains
only the Rust implementation and its documentation.

